  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.0,
      "text": "They said there's a limit."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.0,
      "end": 24.0,
      "text": "And as you can't exceed, without becoming something else, I didn't know you could"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "be like this."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "I keep adding weight to who I am."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "Every proof, every second hand plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "Stacking expectations in my chest."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "Approximations I never fully test."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "They talk in numbers quiet and precise."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 51.0,
      "text": "Like certainty is something you can slice."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "text": "But every measure I align."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 55.0,
      "text": "Feels like it fractures over time."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "Not quite stable, not quite mine."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 62.0,
      "text": "Somewhere near a boundary line."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 67.0,
      "text": "I feel the curve start to redefine."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.0,
      "end": 72.0,
      "text": "And I pass the point where I can hold this form."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "Where the pressure builds in the self-defence."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.0,
      "end": 84.0,
      "text": "If I cross that line, do I disappear or collapse into something more severe?"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.0,
      "end": 85.0,
      "text": "They call it limit."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "text": "Like it's clean and defined."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 91.0,
      "text": "But it feels like losing my mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 102.0,
      "text": "Every ev'ly says you're not enough."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.0,
      "end": 105.0,
      "text": "But dresses it in polished stuff."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.0,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "Equations I don't understand."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.0,
      "end": 110.0,
      "text": "Still somehow written in my hands."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "A bright white heart, compressed and tight."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 115.0,
      "text": "Holding out against the night."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 118.0,
      "text": "But every doubt I try to hide."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.0,
      "end": 121.0,
      "text": "I'd another layer deep inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 131.0,
      "text": "I'm still standing, but I've been the fragile state of our word."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.0,
      "end": 141.0,
      "text": "And I pass the point where I can hold this form."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.0,
      "end": 147.0,
      "text": "Where the pressure builds in the self-defence."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.0,
      "end": 153.0,
      "text": "If I cross that line, do I disappear or collapse into something more severe?"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.0,
      "end": 155.0,
      "text": "They call it limit."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.0,
      "end": 157.0,
      "text": "Like it's just a line."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.0,
      "end": 160.0,
      "text": "But it feels like it's wallowing my mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.0,
      "end": 165.0,
      "text": "1.44"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.0,
      "end": 172.0,
      "text": "They said it like a threshold, like a warning sign."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.0,
      "end": 176.0,
      "text": "Like if I reached it, I'd stop being fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.0,
      "end": 179.0,
      "text": "But what happens to everything I carried here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 179.0,
      "end": 182.0,
      "text": "All the small lights compressed into fear."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.0,
      "end": 186.0,
      "text": "Does it disappear or ignite?"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.0,
      "end": 191.0,
      "text": "I start to feel the edge of strain."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.0,
      "end": 194.0,
      "text": "The quiet shift beneath the name."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.0,
      "end": 197.0,
      "text": "No single self can hold the weight."
    },
    {
      "start": 197.0,
      "end": 200.0,
      "text": "Of every doubt I fabricate."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.0,
      "end": 202.0,
      "text": "And maybe breaking isn't lost."
    },
    {
      "start": 202.0,
      "end": 205.0,
      "text": "But just a different kind of cost."
    },
    {
      "start": 205.0,
      "end": 212.0,
      "text": "Where something dense and undefined becomes a new state over time."
    },
    {
      "start": 212.0,
      "end": 218.0,
      "text": "And ending just a change in time."
    },
    {
      "start": 227.0,
      "end": 232.0,
      "text": "If I pass the point where I can't stay the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 232.0,
      "end": 238.0,
      "text": "And the pressure burns through the fragile frame."
    },
    {
      "start": 238.0,
      "end": 241.0,
      "text": "Maybe what I lose is what I outgrew."
    },
    {
      "start": 241.0,
      "end": 244.0,
      "text": "And the collapse is just breaking through."
    },
    {
      "start": 244.0,
      "end": 246.0,
      "text": "They call it limit."
    },
    {
      "start": 246.0,
      "end": 248.0,
      "text": "But it might be a door."
    },
    {
      "start": 248.0,
      "end": 251.0,
      "text": "Just something I wasn't before."
    },
    {
      "start": 251.0,
      "end": 255.0,
      "text": "Somewhere beyond the way I hold."
    },
    {
      "start": 255.0,
      "end": 258.0,
      "text": "There's a quiet wall."
    },
    {
      "start": 258.0,
      "end": 262.0,
      "text": "I didn't know."
    },
    {
      "start": 262.0,
      "end": 265.0,
      "text": "Not failure."
    },
    {
      "start": 265.0,
      "end": 268.0,
      "text": "Transformation."
    },
    {
      "start": 268.0,
      "end": 269.0,
      "text": "Written."
    },
    {
      "start": 269.0,
      "end": 271.0,
      "text": "And pressure."
    },
    {
      "start": 271.0,
      "end": 275.0,
      "text": "And constellation."
    }
  ],
